          "USER_MVIEWS shows STALE, FRESH, UNUSABLE, the last refresh time, and whether FAST is possible. A chain of MVs on MVs needs a refresh order (base first, then dependents) — DBMS_MVIEW.REFRESH with a nested list or a group. UNUSABLE after DDL cannot simply FAST: a full recompute is required. An application that reads STALE with no policy lies to the user; either return the refresh time or block the read. The nightly window must fit the longest COMPLETE plus a margin.",
          ["Дивіться STALE/UNUSABLE у словнику", "Ланцюжки оновлюють у правильному порядку", "Показуйте свіжість користувачу або не віддавайте застаріле"],
